Non-UDS derivation (e.g. Field Entropy)  -> write_dest_valid = 9'b000000011 (0x3)
UDS derivation                            -> write_dest_valid = 9'b000100011 (0x23)
--------------------------------------------------------------
BUG CONFIRMED: the UDS-derived key's Key-Vault destination-valid mask sets bit 5 (KV_DEST_IDX_AES_KEY)
which the non-UDS derivation path does NOT set. The AES engine's Key-Vault read port
gains direct access to the Unique Device Secret-derived key that was not granted to it
for other, structurally-identical derivations.
